# SonarQube Server / Cloud: connection, repository binding and quality gate (issue #203).
analysis-error-not-configured = No SonarQube connection is set up in Profile → Connections.
analysis-error-invalid-connection = The SonarQube connection settings are not valid.
analysis-error-missing-token = No SonarQube token is saved on this computer. Save one in Profile → Connections.
analysis-error-offline = Network work is paused (offline or metered connection).
analysis-error-cancelled = The SonarQube request was cancelled.
analysis-error-unauthorized = SonarQube refused the token. Check that it is valid and not expired.
analysis-error-forbidden = The token lacks the Browse permission on this project.
analysis-error-project-not-found = SonarQube has no such project, or the token cannot see it.
